  "content": "<p>Small repairs, real impact: the dishwasher wheels had gone brittle over the years. Chris and Chris designed and printed replacements. The first PLA version got a flat right away, but ABS holds. Also rescued: a thyme shaker with a broken lid, now fitted with a new printed lid featuring a &quot;T&quot; hole.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/repair\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>repair</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/3dprinting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>3dprinting</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/repairculture\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>repairculture</span></a></p>",
